# Secrets / credentials — never commit.
# Deliberately broad: a narrower rule once let coiled-data-e4drr_202505.json through,
# and `source-coop creds --format env` writes a live STS token to whatever file you
# point it at. Match the family, not the one filename you happen to be thinking of.
.env
.env.*
*.env
.ecmwfapirc
.ecmwfapirc.*
coiled-data.json
# NOTE: gitignore patterns are CASE-SENSITIVE. `*credential*` did not match
# SOURCE_COOP_CREDENTIALS.md, which sat untracked-but-committable for ten weeks.
# Match every case explicitly rather than trusting the lowercase spelling.
*[Cc][Rr][Ee][Dd][Ee][Nn][Tt][Ii][Aa][Ll]*
*[Cc][Rr][Ee][Dd][Ss]*
*[Ss][Ee][Cc][Rr][Ee][Tt]*
*[Tt][Oo][Kk][Ee][Nn]*
*.pem
*.key

# Competition identifiers — AI_WQ_unique_IDs.csv is the per-team submission ID table.
AI_WQ_unique_IDs.csv

# Local scratch that is deliberately NOT part of the record
check-session.txt
quiz.txt
quiz_v2_answers.md

# Generated ETL / submission outputs
input_states_v2/
input_state_member_*.pkl
ensemble_icechunk_store/
ensemble_nc_files/
ensemble_quintile_probabilities_*.nc
*_20yrCLIM_*_quintiles_*.nc
aiwq_individual_*/
aiwq_plots_*/
aiwq_submission_*.zip
*.grib

# Plots / scratch test artifacts
*.png
test.txt

# Exported conversation transcripts
20*-aifs-*.txt

# Notebook checkpoints
.ipynb_checkpoints/
